(
    title: "A Game of Concentration",
    developer: Some("Jim Heuther"),
    description: Some("A memory game across a grid of sixteen or thirty numbered squares, each hiding one of a paired set of objects — a llama, a flying saucer, a castle. Key in two numbers a turn to turn them face up: match the pair and the squares clear and you go again, miss and the numbers drop back over them. Some variations salt the grid with wild cards that match anything."),
